.TH MAINTAIN-V7.SH 8 "August 2026" "v7.7" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
maintain-v7.sh \- modular system maintenance, security hardening, and vulnerability scanning utility for Debian/Ubuntu-based Linux

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./maintain-v7.sh
.RB [ OPTIONS ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B maintain-v7.sh
is a monolithic Bash script providing a menu-driven interface for system maintenance tasks including antivirus scanning, rootkit detection, file integrity monitoring, kernel hardening, vulnerability assessment, and automated recovery.

.PP
The script requires root privileges for most operations and is designed for Debian-based distributions (Linux Mint 22.3 tested).

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --setup
Run initial setup only (bootstrap all tools). Installs clamav, rkhunter, chkrootkit, aide, lynis, fail2ban, tmpreaper; initializes AIDE baseline; creates drop-in config files.

.PP
(Interactive mode is default — no additional arguments required.)

